The '''Hydra Island''' is the second [[Locations|island]] in the [[Third Sea]].

The Hydra Island is an important area to unlocking many things in [[Third Sea]], such as the [[Yama]] sword, starting the [[Tushita]] sword puzzle, [[Draco]] and its [[Race Awakening]].

The Hydra Island has an subarea called the [[Dragon Dojo]], next to the Hydra Town, where players can learn the [[Dragon Talon]] fighting style for{{Money|3,000,000}}, {{Fragment|5000}}, and a [[Fire Essence]]. This subarea is also where players can acquire the [[Draco]] race and craft/purchase the [[Dragonheart]] and [[Dragonstorm]] weapons.

