==Notes==
* The [[Barista Cousin]] can spawn on this island, in front of the [[Hydra Leader]]'s palace next to a bush.
* The [[Secret Temple]] is located under this island behind the waterfall. This is where the player can obtain the [[Yama]] sword.
* The [[Tushita]] sword quest can be started in a secret room inside the [[Secret Temple]], if [[rip_indra True Form]] is spawned in.
* The [[Training Dummy]] Quest enters a one-hour cooldown after the player defeats the [[Training Dummy]] while the quest is active. However, players can still fight and defeat the [[Training Dummy]] at any time, even when the quest is on cooldown.

