==Trivia==   
* At the Hydra Town, if the player goes to the house in front of the [[Hydra Town Quest Giver]], they can actually enter it. However, nothing is actually inside the building.
* If the player's [[Instinct]] vision range is far enough, they can see the [[Beautiful Pirate]] underneath the [[Hydra Leader]]'s spawn point.
* If the player performs the [[Flash Step]] glitch in the [[Secret Temple]], they can get to the [[Tushita/Puzzle|Tushita Puzzle]] portal and the [[Beautiful Pirate Domain]].
* There are a lot of hitbox issues in Hydra Island, most notably the "invisible wall" in the [[Training Dummy]]'s area, preventing players from using moves such as [[Spikey Trident]]'s [X] move.
* Behind the [[Dragon Crew Warrior|Dragon Crew Warriors]] and [[Dragon Crew Archer|Dragon Crew Archers]], there is a weird piece of floating terrain on a tree.
* Sometimes, the wall in front of the [[Hydra Leader]] and some houses don't load. During this period, these areas will not have their hitboxes loaded, allowing the player to move freely inside them.
* Before [[Giant Islander]]s were replaced with [[Venomous Assailant]], there used to be a typing error that gave {{EXP|645,000,000}} instead of the usual {{EXP|64,500,000}}, making it a large advantage for Max Level farming. Eventually, it was later patched.

